          "Yet not every line of her descendants left.",
          "One particular branch chose to remain on the same African grassland where Lucy had walked, and that branch persists in the same place today.",
          "Human communities still living on the African savannah occupy the same food chain as their unspeaking neighbours and migrate seasonally between dry and wet ranges, an intimacy with the wild that the rest of our species has largely abandoned.",
