          "Egyptian scribes devised hieroglyphs to record harvests, taxes, decrees, and prayers, encoding the operations of the state in a script so durable that we can still decipher it today.",
          "Embalmers extracted the internal organs of the dead and preserved the body in resin and natron salt, producing the mummies that have endured intact for nearly three thousand years.",
          "An elaborate guide to the underworld, the Book of the Dead, was deposited with each corpse to instruct the soul through every judgement it would encounter."
