          "Across the border in Kenya, the mobile-money service called M-Pesa allows farmers without bank accounts to transfer money instantly through old-fashioned keypad phones, and the system has been studied as a model by every European and American fintech firm that subsequently tried to imitate it.",
          "In Nigeria, the Nollywood film industry currently produces more films per year than Hollywood, ranking as the second-largest cinema by volume on the planet.",
          "And in Malawi, a fourteen-year-old boy named William Kamkwamba built a fully functional windmill from a borrowed library textbook, a bicycle dynamo, and rusted scrap during the 2002 famine, illuminating his parents' house for the first time in their married lives.",
